            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia onoŋo tye ki lonyo kacel ki yweka madwoŋ mada. En ogero ot kano lim pi keto ryal, jabu, litino godi me wel, aŋwece, kwodi ki pi jami me wel-gu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogoyo bene dero me kano cam, ka ma en keto iye bel, koŋo vino, ki moo, ogoyo bene dwol pi kit kwa dyaŋ i ducu, ki dwol romi bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En ogero gaŋi mapol pire kene, ocoko romi ki dyaŋi mapol ata; pien Lubaŋa onoŋo omiye jami madwoŋ twatwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En Kejekia acel-li aye oloro wan pii ma tye yo tuŋ malo ka ma pii ma a i Gikon mol kato kwede woko, en dok oyubo omiyo pii omol okemo yo tuŋ potoceŋ i ŋet gaŋ kal pa Daudi. Kejekia obedo ki gum maber kacel ki lonyo i kom ticce ducu ma en otiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ i lok ma dok i kom lukwena pa luker me Babilon, ma gicwalogi bote me penyo en pi lanyut ma onoŋo Lubaŋa otiyo i lobone, Lubaŋa oweko gire pire kene, pi temo en ki pi ŋeyo lok ducu ma tye i cwinve.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
